1. [[kissos|Kissos]]
2. Tikvas
3. Balog
4. Komorn
5. [[mala-nad-nitrau|Mala nad Nitrau]]

## Kissos-Kirin Route
1. [[kissos|Kissos]]
2. Pyrgos
3. Romesion
4. Rethia
5. Kirin

## Achileion Route
